[
  {
    "text": "Werner laps the block three times",
    "start_ind": 357,
    "end_ind": 390
  },
  {
    "text": "he passes a storefront",
    "start_ind": 516,
    "end_ind": 538
  },
  {
    "text": "he walks up",
    "start_ind": 935,
    "end_ind": 946
  },
  {
    "text": "Frederick’s mother swishes out of a side room",
    "start_ind": 1101,
    "end_ind": 1146
  },
  {
    "text": "I was about to go",
    "start_ind": 1687,
    "end_ind": 1704
  },
  {
    "text": "The maid leads him into a grand drawing room",
    "start_ind": 1755,
    "end_ind": 1799
  },
  {
    "text": "walks through a swinging door into what must be a kitchen.",
    "start_ind": 2689,
    "end_ind": 2747
  },
  {
    "text": "Franny has already retreated back into the kitchen.",
    "start_ind": 4832,
    "end_ind": 4883
  },
  {
    "text": "I’m leaving Schulpforta",
    "start_ind": 4972,
    "end_ind": 4995
  },
  {
    "text": "sending me to the front.",
    "start_ind": 5036,
    "end_ind": 5060
  },
  {
    "text": "she lets herself in",
    "start_ind": 6602,
    "end_ind": 6621
  },
  {
    "text": "She scrambles upstairs,",
    "start_ind": 6881,
    "end_ind": 6904
  },
  {
    "text": "scurries to the telephone",
    "start_ind": 7099,
    "end_ind": 7124
  },
  {
    "text": "He returns to Madame Manec’s bedside",
    "start_ind": 7149,
    "end_ind": 7185
  },
  {
    "text": "the kitchen fills with women",
    "start_ind": 7216,
    "end_ind": 7244
  },
  {
    "text": "Marie-Laure paces the staircase",
    "start_ind": 7332,
    "end_ind": 7363
  },
  {
    "text": "The doctor comes and goes",
    "start_ind": 7464,
    "end_ind": 7489
  },
  {
    "text": "doctor returns with a man",
    "start_ind": 7634,
    "end_ind": 7659
  },
  {
    "text": "carries her out into the street",
    "start_ind": 7757,
    "end_ind": 7788
  },
  {
    "text": "The outer gate sighs shut, then the front door closes",
    "start_ind": 8195,
    "end_ind": 8248
  },
  {
    "text": "he closed the gate first, then shut the door.",
    "start_ind": 8356,
    "end_ind": 8401
  },
  {
    "text": "Marie-Laure imagines charging past the bathroom into the cobwebbed sewing room here on the third floor",
    "start_ind": 9212,
    "end_ind": 9314
  },
  {
    "text": "hurling herself out the window",
    "start_ind": 9319,
    "end_ind": 9349
  },
  {
    "text": "You have to move",
    "start_ind": 9536,
    "end_ind": 9552
  },
  {
    "text": "The footfalls travel toward Madame Manec’s room.",
    "start_ind": 9573,
    "end_ind": 9621
  },
  {
    "text": "He exits the kitchen",
    "start_ind": 10007,
    "end_ind": 10027
  },
  {
    "text": "Returns to the foyer.",
    "start_ind": 10029,
    "end_ind": 10050
  },
  {
    "text": "just as he sets his foot on the first stair",
    "start_ind": 10220,
    "end_ind": 10263
  },
  {
    "text": "Marie-Laure takes each step as deliberately as she can.",
    "start_ind": 10423,
    "end_ind": 10478
  },
  {
    "text": "Up to the fourth floor.",
    "start_ind": 10638,
    "end_ind": 10661
  },
  {
    "text": "The fifth",
    "start_ind": 10683,
    "end_ind": 10692
  },
  {
    "text": "On the sixth-floor landing, she pauses",
    "start_ind": 10694,
    "end_ind": 10732
  },
  {
    "text": "the German climb three or four more stairs",
    "start_ind": 10787,
    "end_ind": 10829
  },
  {
    "text": "Then on again.",
    "start_ind": 10864,
    "end_ind": 10878
  },
  {
    "text": "His footfalls cross the landing.",
    "start_ind": 11382,
    "end_ind": 11414
  },
  {
    "text": "Climbing again.",
    "start_ind": 11454,
    "end_ind": 11469
  },
  {
    "text": "She squeezes into the tiny space",
    "start_ind": 12082,
    "end_ind": 12114
  },
  {
    "text": "I visited my father.",
    "start_ind": 13023,
    "end_ind": 13043
  },
  {
    "text": "It took him forever just to cross his kitchen.",
    "start_ind": 13114,
    "end_ind": 13160
  },
  {
    "text": "You can go off with your friends",
    "start_ind": 13409,
    "end_ind": 13441
  },
  {
    "text": "I left",
    "start_ind": 13599,
    "end_ind": 13605
  },
  {
    "text": "I went down the stairs and into the street",
    "start_ind": 13621,
    "end_ind": 13663
  },
  {
    "text": "I had ridden trains all goddamn day to see him",
    "start_ind": 13741,
    "end_ind": 13787
  },
  {
    "text": "But I left",
    "start_ind": 13789,
    "end_ind": 13799
  },
  {
    "text": "Volkheimer carrying Bernd into a corner",
    "start_ind": 14080,
    "end_ind": 14119
  },
  {
    "text": "Von Rumpel limps through the rooms",
    "start_ind": 15236,
    "end_ind": 15270
  },
  {
    "text": "He climbs to the fifth floor,",
    "start_ind": 15692,
    "end_ind": 15721
  },
  {
    "text": "To the sixth floor.",
    "start_ind": 15963,
    "end_ind": 15982
  },
  {
    "text": "Back to the landing",
    "start_ind": 16152,
    "end_ind": 16171
  },
  {
    "text": "as he sits on the edge of the bed",
    "start_ind": 16925,
    "end_ind": 16958
  }
]